QuestGuidance.Register("en",271,{
[8641]="70069079\n1\tComplete Mission: An Infestation of Crabs\tYour mission is to protect the merchant ship Khâlbina on its trip to Jax Phanâl. Speak to Deshra to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Deshra\tYou have successfully defeated the crabs and protected the Khâlbina! Return with the Umbari scout to the mission giver with this report.\n",
[8642]="70071DF7\n1\tComplete Mission: An Ordinary Man\tYour mission is to investigate Bâdrasag, the Blade-horn, for any sign of a suspicious man who may be making it his refuge. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have defeated the ordinary-looking man. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8643]="70071E04\n1\tComplete Mission: Another Man's Treasure\tYour mission is to journey to the ponds of Charganpâta and investigate claims of theft by a strange man living among the zizani. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have gathered the stolen possessions and defeated Zâwakhar. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with your report.\n",
[8644]="70057F88\n1\tComplete Mission: Archers at the Gate\tYour mission is to defeat the Orc archers outside Shathur-munzu. Speak to Hórin to travel to Shathur-munzu.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete. Speak to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8645]="70057F8C\n1\tDefeat Gundabad black-arrows (total: 10)\tDefeat the Orc archers outside Shathur-munzu.\n",
[8646]="70058C71\n1\tComplete Mission: Area of Interest\tYour mission is to survey the ruins of Stormwall. Speak to Hórin to travel to Stormwall.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8647]="70058C78\n1\tSurvey Stormwall (total: 10)\tSurvey Stormwall.\n",
[8648]="70073039\n1\tComplete Mission: Arms Saboteur\tYour mission is to enter the area, seek out the equipment while it's vulnerable and destroy it.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have sabotaged the weapons within the barracks and defeated the mighty Mádathal the Deathward.\n",
[8649]="700583E8\n1\tDestroy ballistae in Ashmâr-zarakh (total: 4)\tYour mission is to destroy ballistae in Ashmâr-zarakh.\n",
[8650]="70058426\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Assault on Ashmâr-zarakh'\tYour mission is to destroy ballistae in Ashmâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Ashmâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8651]="7005A81E\n1\tSecure the southern gate\030Secure the southern courtyard\030Secure the northern courtyard\030Secure the northern gate\030Collect stolen supplies (total: 15)\tYou should secure Dûn Traikh and collect stolen supplies.\n",
[8652]="7005A820\n1\tComplete Mission: Assault on Dûn Traikh\tYour mission is to defeat Angmarim at Dûn Traikh and recover stolen supplies. Speak to Ausma to travel to Dûn Traikh.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8653]="7006D1C1\n1\tComplete Mission: Assault on Khetsok\tYour mission is to help the Dumûri by assaulting the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to enter the fray.\n2\tTalk to Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have helped the Dumûri assault the Ordâkhai camp of Khetsok. Return with the Dumûri scout to report your success.\n",
[8654]="70059558\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the tunnel to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDefend Trestlebridge against the first assault!\tYou should defend against the first assault. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tDefend Trestlebridge against the second assault!\tYou should defend against the second assault. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tDefend Trestlebridge against the third assault!\tYou should defend against the third assault. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n6\tDefend Trestlebridge against the final assault!\tYou should defend against the final assault. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8655]="70059559\n1\tComplete Mission: Assault on Trestlebridge\tYour mission is to defend Trestlebridge from an assault by the enemies of the Free Peoples. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8656]="70059565\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the western entrance to Cotfast to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tRetrieve stolen goods (total: 10)\030Free caged animals (total: 10)\tYou should retrieve stolen goods and free caged animals at Cotfast. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tReturn to the western entrance of Cotfast\tYou should return to entrance to Cotfast. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8657]="70059569\n1\tComplete Mission: Attack on Cotfast\tYour mission is to thwart the efforts of foes dwelling in the village of Cotfast. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8658]="70066B55\n1\tThe town where I was recruited was under assault and not for the first time. The captain directed us to defend the town and save the inhabitants who were taken by the Corsair crew.\t\n2\tReturn to the captain near the docked ship\tAfter the townsfolk were safe, the crew returned to the captain to tell them what they discovered.\n",
[8659]="700581A5\n1\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have been assigned another important mission! Report to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu to learn the details.\n2\tComplete Mission: Attack on the Armoury\tYour mission is to infiltrate Dâr Brulku with Ausma and destroy the weapons and armour within. Talk to Ausma to travel to Dâr Brulku.\n3\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! You should talk to Ausma in Annâk-khurfu.\n4\tTalk to Glóin\tThe mission is complete! You should report your success to Glóin in Annâk-khurfu.\n",
[8660]="700581AC\n1\tPick up the Summoning Horn\tUse the summoning horn at the entrance to the fort to summon Ausma to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Ausma skill and talk to Ausma\tYou should talk to Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDestroy Orc armour (total: 5)\030Destroy Orc weapons (total: 5)\030Destroy Orc bows (total: 5)\030Destroy Orc swords (total: 5)\030Destroy Orc spears (total: 5)\tDestroy Orc weapons and armour in Ashmâr-zarakh with Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tTalk to Ausma\tYou have destroyed many weapons and suits of armour, but the fort is just too large to destroy it all. You should talk to Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n5\tFind the ramp to the second floor\tYou have heard some commotion coming from the floor above you. You should find the way up to the second floor. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n6\tTalk to Ausma\tYou should talk to Ausma. If you somehow become separated from Ausma, use the summoning horn at the fort entrance to summon her to your side. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n7\tSneak past the drunk Orcs to the third floor\tYou have learned that all of the missing Orcs are upstairs, and drunk! You should sneak past the drunk Orcs and find the quartermaster. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n8\tDefeat Quartermaster Khorglam\tYou have reached the third floor of the fort. You should find and defeat Quartermaster Khorglam with Ausma. If Ausma is missing, and the Call Ausma skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8661]="700585A5\n1\tDefeat the hill-beasts on the path to Glimmerdeep (total: 11)\tDefeat the hill-beasts on the path to Glimmerdeep.\n",
[8662]="700585B4\n1\tComplete Mission: Beasts From the Hills\tYour mission is to defeat the hill-beasts who have descended upon the path to Glimmerdeep. Speak to Ausma to travel to Glimmerdeep.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8663]="7006EC2F\n1\tComplete Mission: Becoming a Thorn\tYour mission is to sabotage siege engines that have been discovered in a nearby Ekhamâti camp and eliminate any soldiers that try and stop you. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to sabotage siege engines that have been discovered in a nearby Ekhamâti camp and eliminate any soldiers that try and stop you.\n",
[8664]="70062FB5\n1\tComplete the Mission: Before They Bond\tSpeak with the mission giver and have them lead you to the wolf camp so that you can drive the brigands out before they find new wolves to join their ranks.\n2\tTalk to Irvo Curch\tWith the threat addressed it is time to return to Lhan Garan and report your success to the mission giver there.\n",
[8665]="70062FB7\n1\tDefeat wolf-keepers (total: 16)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8666]="70062FC5\n1\tDefeat the White Hand war-leader\030Defeat melee Uruk-hai of the White Hand (total: 7)\030Defeat ranged Uruk-hai of the White Hand (total: 7)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8667]="70062FCE\n1\tComplete the Mission: Bite the Hand\tSpeak with the mission giver and travel to the location of the Uruk encampment and defeat the war-leader there.\n2\tTalk to Hithriel\tReturn to the mission giver and let them know of your victory over the White Hand.\n",
[8668]="70070CC7\n1\tComplete Mission: Blight in the Bite\tYour mission is to travel north to Thalat Tîr to thin the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as bring back samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully thinned the numbers of vicious spiders in the area as well as gathered samples of their venom for the Sul Madásh scholars to study.\n",
[8669]="700585A1\n1\tDefeat Magathlug\tDefeat Magathlug, leader of the troll blockade.\n",
